From b9189f09005cbd7e1edb35a3435cb1581c1656eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 18:31:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 559/572] fix(st-pmic): initialize state in
 stpmic2_dump_regulators()
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

stpmic2_regulator_get_state() leaves 'state' untouched on error, so the
dump could print an uninitialized EN/DIS status. Initialize it to false.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 401f62bc8ae4a098b8520e34ed92343222b5e305 fix(st-pmic): initialize state in stpmic2_dump_regulators()]
Change-Id: I976fced7b80c0ce489aa73db86d03aa6723b5839
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/598257
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 drivers/st/pmic/stpmic2.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/st/pmic/stpmic2.c b/drivers/st/pmic/stpmic2.c
index 6575113760..3ad309c9d0 100644
--- a/drivers/st/pmic/stpmic2.c
+++ b/drivers/st/pmic/stpmic2.c
@@ -467,7 +467,7 @@ void stpmic2_dump_regulators(struct pmic_handle_s *pmic)
 
 	for (i = 0U; i < ARRAY_SIZE(regul_table); i++) {
 		uint16_t val;
-		bool state;
+		bool state = false;
 
 		if (!regul_table[i].volt_cr) {
 			continue;
-- 
